OL,3,GNEWSACourt action against nurse trapped
OL,4,Ain lift dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FCourt action has been dropped against a
OL,7,FDudley nurse who received a parking
OL,8,Ffine after being stuck in a lift while
OL,9,Fvisiting a sick child.
OL,11,FCommunity nurse Lisa Smith spent an
OL,12,Fhour and 15 minutes in a block of flats
OL,13,Fin Perry Barr Village, Birmingham, in
OL,14,FNovember 2025. She parked in a
OL,15,Fpermit-only bay, which medical staff
OL,16,Fare allowed to do for 30 minutes, but
OL,17,Fwas trapped in a lift for more than 20
OL,18,Fminutes before being freed by a
OL,19,Fresident.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
