OL,3,GNEWSACourt action against nurse trapped
OL,4,Ain lift dropped
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe later received a notice that Civil
OL,7,FEnforcement Ltd was taking her to court
OL,8,Fto recover a penalty charge of #266.
OL,9,FSmith said she believes she is owed an
OL,10,Fapology.
OL,12,FThe BBC has contacted Civil Enforcement
OL,13,FLtd for comment.
